    "localmaxxing": {
      "backend": "rocm",
      "hardware_label": "Ryzen AI Max 395",
      "notes": "Single client, single GPU, non-batched. NOT tensor-parallel, NOT pipeline-parallel, NOT a batched serve: one request at a time via the standalone dflash_spec_demo binary, not an HTTP server. Integrated Radeon 8060S (gfx1151, RDNA3.5) in a Ryzen AI MAX+ 395; the iGPU addresses 103.1 GB of the unified pool, ~30 GB remains to the host. Host also has 3 dGPUs; only the iGPU is used here. RDNA3.5 counterpart to our gfx1201 and gfx1100 entries.\nPure DFlash speculative decode: 5-layer trained draft head, B=16, adaptive-B 8..16 settled at 16. No MTP, n-gram, prompt-lookup, tree or CASK. Greedy temp 0.0, deterministic. Every rep: tau=11.3846, accept_rate=0.7590, emitted=162, EOS reached.\n5 fresh-process reps after one discarded JIT warmup, GPU-lock serialized, clocks untouched: 111.96/111.96/111.96/111.88/112.37 -> median 111.96, spread 0.44%.\nHIPFIRE_HFQ4G256_LDSSTAGE=1 (default off) is live on RDNA3.5 via the gfx11 sibling path: same-binary A/B gives 99.09 off (3 reps, 0.07% spread), i.e. +12.99% -- the largest of the three archs measured (+9.06% gfx1201, +10.60% gfx1100), consistent with staging trading DRAM traffic for LDS reuse on the most bandwidth-limited part. Routing verified: gemm_gate_up_hfq4g256_wmma_ldsstage.hsaco (17040 B) + gemm_hfq4g256_residual_wmma_ldsstage.hsaco (22288 B) under .hipfire_kernels/gfx1151/. HIPFIRE_Q8_PREFILL_M4=0 is gfx12-gated, inert here, set for command parity.\nNOT bit-exact by construction: LDS staging reorders f32 K-accumulation. Output still matched our gfx1201/gfx1100 runs byte-for-byte (md5 4d3a55e4), tau equal to 4 decimals across all three; one prompt at temp 0, not a quality result.\nQuantized artifact: schuttdev/hipfire-qwen3.6-27b @ f9b326a657f1 (qwen3.6-27b.mq4).\nProvenance: tree 98d3567e29500326cb0b6313b79648c9510b249e (beta); trunk sha256 86a5f80fd29d545a; draft md5 204c4c4c; prompt md5 253c7ac5; ROCm/HIP 7.14. peakVramGb = 17180 MiB per runtime.",
      "observed_command": "HIP_VISIBLE_DEVICES=1 HIPFIRE_HFQ4G256_LDSSTAGE=1 HIPFIRE_Q8_PREFILL_M4=0 ./target/release/examples/dflash_spec_demo --target ~/.hipfire/models/qwen3.6-27b-awq.mq4 --draft ~/.hipfire/models/qwen36-27b-dflash-mq4.hf4 --prompt-file benchmarks/prompts/merge_sort_thinking_off.txt --max 256 --temp 0.0 --no-chatml --kv-mode q8 --ctx 2048",
